## Revisit at checkpoints
At each `campaign-status` checkpoint: is the goal still the right goal? Have expectations shifted on the
evidence? Are tasks still serving it, or has a discovery unblocked a parked direction (re-open it)? Is
complexity climbing without payoff (a pivot signal — see `docs/reference/pivoting.md`)?
